## Development

The toolchain is a nix flake. [direnv](https://direnv.net/) loads it through `.envrc`; otherwise run
`nix develop` (or one-shot: `nix develop -c just <recipe>`).

```sh
just                # list recipes
just lint           # run every linter (what CI runs)
just install-hooks  # install the prek git hooks
```

